The reference table data/ada_reference.csv is a compilation of 289 marketed
biologics assembled by the ADA Predictor authors. The provenance of each row is
recorded in its `source`, `ada_citation` and `sequence_citation` fields. The
compilation as a whole, together with the derived fields added by the authors
(the normalised drug class, the route, the approval flag, the NAb annotation and
the sequence split into heavy and light chains), is released under CC BY 4.0.
The upstream sources are attributed below.

