   `source` column), the corresponding patient-weighted statistics and, for those
   entries, the antibody sequences.
   The values were not modified; where a single patient-weighted mean was
   derived from the published cohorts, the cohort and patient counts are given
   in the `notes` column so that the derivation can be checked.

